keiichi: Hey, Rena[p]...[p=xxl] Is there something[p]...[p=xl] that everyone is keeping from me?
rena: Huh?[p=xl] No.[p=m] Not at all.
keiichi: ...[p=xxl] You're lying,[p=l] aren't you?
Rena suddenly stopped.
Her expression was cold and intense.
rena: What do you mean by that,[p=s] Keiichi-kun?
Her tone was still the same cheery and lighthearted one as before.
keiichi: You are,[p=m] aren't you? [p]...[p=l]Keeping something from me?
After understanding what I meant,[p=m] her expression grew even more intense.
Seeing that face,[p=s] I regretted saying something so rash.
...[p=m]But she came back at me in a way I didn't expect.
rena: Well then,[p=m] Keiichi-kun.[p=xl] Aren't you keeping something from us?
Her tone didn't change,[p=s] but it was the first time I'd seen this expression from her.
With how her gaze pierced through me,[p=m] I couldn't believe this was the same Rena.
rena: Aren't you?[p=xl] Lies[p=l] or secrets.[p=xl] ...Aren't you?
You are.[p=xl] Secrets.
She didn't actually say that part,[p=m] but she looked as if she did.
The incident with Tomitake-san,[p=s] and how I felt alienated from the group.
Even without having to think about it,[p=l] there were things I knew I felt guilty about.
But[p]...[p=xl] I didn't tell everyone about what happened with Tomitake-san[p=xl]... to be considerate.
I was keeping it a secret just the same way they didn't tell me about Oyashiro-sama.
Then[p]...[p=xl] aren't we even[p]...?
keiichi: No,[p=m] I'm not.[p=xl] No lies.[p=l] Nor secrets.
rena: Liar.
Her answer was instant[p=m] and it shook me.
Rena stared as if burrowing through me.
Watching me.[p=m] Like a hawk.
keiichi: Why would you say that I'm lying?
rena: Didn't you say that you were called into the teacher's room yesterday during the club meeting, Keiichi-kun?
rena: I know[p]...[p=xl] you didn't go to the teacher's room.
I swallowed hard.
It clearly wasn't a bluff.[p=l] She knew what happened.
rena: The teacher said you had a guest,[p=s] didn't she?
rena: But you didn't talk at the entrance.[p=l] You talked inside of a car near the school gate.[p=l] With some man we don't know.
Rena knew everything.
She knew that I was called out by Ooishi-san[p=s] and that I heard about the incident with Tomitake-san as well.[p=l] Did she know all of it?!
rena: Exactly who was that man?
keiichi: [lspeed=0.05]I-I [lspeed=0.02]don't know him!
rena: Why did someone you don't know have business with you?
keiichi: I[p]...[p=m] I want to know that myself!
rena: Then what did you talk about?
keiichi: It has nothing to do with you guys...!
It was a lie.
[wait time="2.0" hide_text="false"]
rena: LIES!!!
Rena's scream echoed through the trees...
Sending frightened birds into the air.
I couldn't exhale the deep breath I had just taken.
No.[p=s] It was like I wasn't allowed to exhale.
It was here...[p=s] I first realized.
The person standing in front of me...[p=xl] She wasn't Rena Ryuugu.
Then,[p=s] who was it that was standing before me now?
Who had assumed Rena Ryuugu's appearance?
I held my breath for so long I could feel myself suffocating...
rena: Right?
And then she made a facial expression that Rena normally might have made.
It didn't matter that it was Rena's usual smile...[p=l] It chilled me to the bone.
She drew closer to me.
I felt her breath against my face.
It wasn't the least bit exciting.
Whoever this was with Rena's face was going to chew my nose right off!
...I cowered as I imagined that.
Then,[p=s] she smirked as if she could see right through me.
rena: We also have secrets~[p=l] ...just like how Keiichi-kun has secrets~.
It was Rena's usual smile...[p=l] but her eyes were still like that of a hawk's.
Bringing her face close enough to mine to almost bump into my nose...[p=m] she "kindly" persuaded me.
I couldn't nod or shake my head.
This person standing in front of me...[p=xl] this person who looked like Rena,[p=l] frightened me to my core.
I was terrified knowing that she could hear the sound of me swallowing nervously.
[wait time="2.0"]
After what felt like an eternity,[p=s] she finally spoke.
rena: Let's go.[p=s] It's getting chilly.
It was Rena again.
Smiling at me once more,[p=s] she started walking as if nothing at all had happened.
...[p=l]When I was released from her gaze,[p=s] my legs gave out from under me[p=s] and I slumped onto the ground.
...[p=l]I wasn't able to lift a finger until Rena was out of sight.
keiichi: Who was...[p=m] that...?
I felt cold.[p=xl] My body was drenched in sweat.
I was finally able to form a coherent thought[p=l] and asked myself once again.
Who was...[p=l] that person...[p=xl] who looked like Rena Ryuugu?
